  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[algoliasearch-helper](https://www.npmjs.com/package/algoliasearch-helper) just published its new version 2.13.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :warning:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      algoliasearch-helper\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      2.13.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      dependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build kept failing**.\n\n**It looks like your project, in its current form, is malfunctioning** and this update didn’t really change that. I don’t want to leave you in the dark about updates though. I recommend you get your project passing and then check the impact of this update again.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 59 commits .\n- [`6cded09`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/6cded098ec93c226d6a39acbcbcd09ac27135ec1) <code>2.13.0 - 2016-08-24</code>\n- [`252414a`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/252414a9beb476d67bccd6b72101dead95bd5afc) <code>Merge branch 'develop'</code>\n- [`2d2ead3`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/2d2ead34f7de091b0fa00e575374665bf12d5c2d) <code>Merge pull request #359 from algolia/fix/354</code>\n- [`d64860a`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/d64860ad595eea058084aeec10fc8ecd7d0b65b7) <code>fix(getFacetValues) Fix the ordering when not specified</code>\n- [`939efa0`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/939efa08687987b14b4250660ea8a89ab3a51b74) <code>Merge pull request #356 from algolia/fix/320</code>\n- [`ded4cb2`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/ded4cb22a9bc34282a70c8c973145215270b21b9) <code>Merge pull request #355 from algolia/feat/clearCache</code>\n- [`fae498c`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/fae498c9f59b00428bdd8f9234a71687e3bb90da) <code>fix(hierarchical-facets) do not throw if no refinements</code>\n- [`7473e74`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/7473e748892293c6cb7fdae0e394dbe1b0b85e08) <code>feat(helper) expose clearCache from the client Fix #345</code>\n- [`9fcd3f7`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/9fcd3f79d2c37dab577e3e53338c105f34a89fab) <code>doc(readme) Update build shield to develop</code>\n- [`852f902`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/852f9020803606d95ad497791397f812e77fa498) <code>doc(readme) remove sauce lab matrix</code>\n- [`5621d53`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/5621d53b0ce227ea6f28efea71b3e27267dfecc0) <code>test(chore) Strip down to test only on node</code>\n- [`b2b7e2c`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/b2b7e2c6608b1c69125e971d7789ce01ec445ad2) <code>test(chore) Update browsers list</code>\n- [`459ac00`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/459ac00fdcd63aa5e08ca73bd8f1c11aacf3eab9) <code>doc(misc) Fix JS on main page + CTA to examples</code>\n- [`1a8412a`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/1a8412a0036da9efce280aa05e3f47cf7dba7696) <code>doc(getting-started) Fix algolia search package name</code>\n- [`b09e397`](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/commit/b09e3974b7c8ae0a13d12518e392fa9b8db029bb) <code>doc(misc): typo fix (#346)</code>\n\nThere are 59 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js/compare/6c8bb687f668a3fb756c2e5e16bedafbc92cb11d...6cded098ec93c226d6a39acbcbcd09ac27135ec1).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
